ne-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n    padding: 15px;\n}\n.aviva-fixed-available {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our live chat service is one of the quickest ways to get support. Connect with our team using the button below.</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-available\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n<p><b>MyAviva Support Team opening hours:</b><br/>Monday - Friday - 08:00 - 18:00<br/>Saturday - 09:00 - 17:00<br/>Sunday - 10:00 - 16:00</p>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n    padding: 15px;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our Live Chat system is the quickest way to get support for your customers.</p>\n<p>All of our agents are currently busy, but please keep this page open and we'll refresh this status automatically.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n<p>Alternatively, you can complete this <a href=\"https://www.avivaworld.com/sites/uk-cs-ba-life-myaviva-online-support\">form</a> and we'll be in touch.</p>\n<p><b>Important: due to the volume of emails we receive, we recommend that you wait until we're available or try our Live Chat again later. This will result in faster turnaround time for your query.</b></p>\n<p><b>MyAviva Support Team opening hours:</b></p>Monday - Friday - 08:00 - 18:00<br/>Saturday - 09:00 - 17:00<br/>Sunday - 10:00 - 16:00</p>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n    padding: 15px;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our Live Chat system is the quickest way to get support for your customers.</p>\n<p>We are unfortunately not open right now, please contact us tomorrow during our opening hours.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you can complete this <a href=\"https://www.avivaworld.com/sites/uk-cs-ba-life-myaviva-online-support\">form</a> and we'll be in touch.</p>\n<p><b>Important: due to the volume of emails we receive, we recommend that you wait until we're available or t