led {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>All our Live Chat team members are busy helping others right now.</p>\n<p>When a team member is free, we’ll update this message to let you know.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start live chat</a>\n<p>You can speak to our team during these times:</p>\n<p><b>Monday to Friday</b>: 7:00am – 8:00pm<br/><b>Saturday</b>: 8:00am - 5:00pm<br/><b>Sunday</b>: 8:00am - 4:00pm</p>\n<p>Hours may vary on Bank Holidays.</p>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Sorry, live chat is closed right now.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start live chat</a>\n<p>You can speak to our Live Chat team during these times:</p>\n<p><b>Monday to Friday</b>: 7:00am - 8:00pm<br/><b>Saturday</b>: 8:00am - 5:00pm<br/><b>Sunday</b>: 8:00am - 4:00pm</p>\n<p>Hours may vary on Bank Holidays.</p>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001757:{id:33001757,name:"AV-UKD-AZ_Livechat",r:"<style>\n.aviva-button-available {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 100%;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed-available {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>For now, the quickest way to get in touch is via our Live Chat service.</p>\n<hr>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-available\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our Live Chat is open however, <b>all our chat agents are currently busy</b> supporting other customers.</p>\n<br/>\n<p>We'll keep checking the teams availability for you and update this message when we're able to connect you.</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n    .aviva-button-disabled {\n        background-color: #ccc;\n        border-color: #ccc;\n        color: #535353;\n        box-shadow: none;\n        cursor: default;\n        pointer-events: none;\n        appearance: none;\n        border: 1px solid #737373;\n        border-width: 0;\n        border-radius: 0.25em;\n        font-size: 1em;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        line-height: 1.5625em;\n        margin: 0;\n        min-width: 6.25em;\n        padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n        position: relative;\n        text-align: center;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        user-select: none;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n    .aviva-fixed p {\n        margin: 0.625em 0;\n    }\n    a.aviva-fixed-href {\n        background-color: #ffd900;\n        border-color: #ccc;\n        color: #004fb6;\n        box-shadow: none;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        appearance: none;\n        border: 1px solid #737373;\n        border-width: 0;\n        border-radius: 0.25em;\n        font-size: 1em;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        line-height: 1.5625em;\n        margin: 0;\n        min-width: 6.25em;\n        padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n        position: relative;\n        text-align: center;\n        text-decoration: none;\n        user-select: none;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n        display: inline-block;\n        width: 100%;  \n       }\n       a.aviva-fixed-href:hover {\n        cursor: pointer;\n        background-color: #004fb6;\n        color: #fff;\n         border-color: #fff;\n         border-bottom-style: solid;\n       }\n    </style>\n    \n    <div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n    <p>Our Live Chat service is currently <b>closed</b>, please contact us via our enquiry form.</p>\n    <hr/>\n    <p>When you fill in the form, a member of our team will aim to respond to you within 24 hours.</p>\n    <br/>\n    <a class=\"aviva-fixed-href\" href=\"https://zero.aviva.co.uk/customer-support\">Fill in enquiries form</a>\n    <p>\n    <hr/>\n    <p>Our Live Chat service is currently <b>closed.</b></p>\n    <br/>\n    <button disabled=\"true\" class=\"aviva-button-disabled\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</button>\n    </div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001758:{id:33001758,name:"AV-UKD-IVA-MM",r:"<style>\n.aviva-button-available {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed-available {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\