ve;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>All our Live Chat team members are busy helping others right now.</p>\n<p>When a team member is free, we’ll update this message to let you know.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start live chat</a>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Sorry, live chat is closed right now.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start live chat</a>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001766:{id:33001766,name:"AV-UKD-IVA-MAOST",r:"<style>\n.aviva-button-available {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed-available {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our live chat service is one of the quickest ways to get support. Connect with our team using the button below.</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-available\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n<p><b>MyAviva Support Team opening hours:</b></p>\n<p>Monday to Friday- 8:00 – 18:00<br/>Saturday- 9:00 – 17:00<br/>Sunday- 10:00 – 16:00</p>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Unfortunately, all our agents are busy right now, please try again later. Our opening hours are listed below.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n<p><b>MyAviva Support Team opening hours:</b></p>\n<p>Monday to Friday- 8:00 – 18:00<br/>Saturday- 9:00 – 17:00<br/>Sunday- 10:00 – 16:00</p>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Unfortunately, you have reached us outside of our opening times listed below. Please contact us, during the opening hours and we'll be happy to help.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n<p><b>MyAviva Support Team opening hours:</b></p>\n<p>Monday to Friday- 8:00 – 18:00<br/>Saturday- 9:00 – 17:00<br/>Sunday- 10:00 – 16:00</p>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001768:{id:33001768,name:"AV-QMH-Support-MotorVA",r:"<style>\n.QMH-anchored-aval {\n cursor: pointer;\n    outline: none;\n font-family: 'source_sans_probold',-apple-system,blinkmacsystemfont,'Segoe UI','Roboto','Oxygen','Ubuntu','Cantarell','Fira Sans','Droid Sans','Helvetica Neue','arial','helvetica',sans-serif;\n font-size: 16px; \n font-weight: 400;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #04A404 0%, #037D03 100%);  \n    border-color: linear-gradient(180deg, #04A404 0%, #037D03 100%);\n    border-style: solid;\n border-radius: .25em;\n box-shadow: 0 0 8px 0 #CCCCCC; \n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    padding: .5em 2.803em;\n    text-align: center;\n    left: 30%;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 9999999999999999; \n} \n.QMH-anchored-aval:hover {