 <a href=\"https://help.quotemehappy.com/contact-form\">contact form</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"QMH-p\" style=\"color: #0a5b0c;\">Our operating hours are:<br>Monday to Friday, 8:00am to 8:00pm<br/>Saturday, 9:00am to 5:00pm<br/>Sundays and bank holidays, 10:00am to 4:00pm</p>\n<button class=\"QMH-anchored-aval button yellow\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Click to chat\" role=\"button\">Live Chat<span class=\"QMH-anchored-aval-svg\" alt=\"\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 22.54 22.54\" width=\"22px\" height=\"22px\"><path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"M14.34,12.17V6.91a.76.76,0,0,0-.75-.75H6.08a.75.75,0,0,0-.75.75v5.26a.74.74,0,0,0,.75.75h.2l0,1.38,1.35-1.38h6A.75.75,0,0,0,14.34,12.17Z\"/><path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"M15.82,8.44h-.73v4.48a.75.75,0,0,1-.75.75H7.93v.78a.76.76,0,0,0,.75.75h5.6l1.36,1.38,0-1.38h.2a.76.76,0,0,0,.75-.75V9.19A.75.75,0,0,0,15.82,8.44Z\"/><path class=\"cls-1\" d=\"M11.27,0A11.27,11.27,0,1,0,22.54,11.27,11.28,11.28,0,0,0,11.27,0Zm0,21A9.77,9.77,0,1,1,21,11.27,9.78,9.78,0,0,1,11.27,21Z\"/></svg></span></button>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.QMH-anchored-aval {\n cursor: default;\n        pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    outline: none;\n font-family: 'source_sans_probold',-apple-system,blinkmacsystemfont,'Segoe UI','Roboto','Oxygen','Ubuntu','Cantarell','Fira Sans','Droid Sans','Helvetica Neue','arial','helvetica',sans-serif;\n font-size: 16px; \n font-weight: 400;\n    background: #ccc;  \n    border-color: #737373;\n    border-style: solid;\n border-radius: .25em;\n box-shadow: 0 0 8px 0 #CCCCCC; \n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    padding: .5em 2.803em;\n    text-align: center;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 9999999999999999; \n}\n\n.QMH-anchored-aval:focus {\n    outline: 1px solid black;\n}\n\n.QMH-p {\n    width: 90%; /* Dynamic width */\n    max-width: 26em; /* Limit max width */\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #0a5b0c;\n    line-height: 1.5em;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 1em auto; /* Center horizontally and add spacing */\n}\n.QMH-anchored-aval-svg {\n position: relative;\n top: 2px;\n margin: 0 0 0 10px;\n fill: #ffffff;\n float: right;\n}\n</style>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p class=\"QMH-p\" style=\"color: #0a5b0c;\">Sorry, live chat isn't available right now. Please come back during our operating hours:</p>\n<p class=\"QMH-p\" style=\"color: #0a5b0c;\">Monday to Friday, 8:00am to 8:00pm<br/>Saturday, 9:00am to 5:00pm<br/>Sundays and bank holidays, 10:00am to 4:00pm</p>\n<p class=\"QMH-p\" style=\"color: #0a5b0c;\">Alternatively, you can use our <a href=\"https://help.quotemehappy.com/contact-form\">contact form</a>. And we’ll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001774:{id:33001774,name:"AV-UKD-IVA-Health",r:"<style>\n.aviva-button-available {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed-available {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Welcome to Aviva Live Chat! Please click the button below to connect with our team.</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-available\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Thank you for reaching out to us. Due to a high volume of requests, we are currently experiencing delays. Please try again later, and we appreciate your patience.</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Thank you for contacting us. We are currently closed. Our opening hours are 8am-6:30pm Monday-Friday and 9am-1pm Saturdays.  You can submit new claims and update existing claims by logging into your MyAviva account.</p>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001776:{id:33001776,name:"AV-UKD-IVA-Protection",r:"<style>\n.aviva-Nuance-button-available {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-Nuance-button-available:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-available:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n  cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed a.aviva-Nuance-button-available {\n  cursor: pointer !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Welcome to Aviva Live Chat! Please click the button below to connect with our team.</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-Nuance-button-available\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-Nuance-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353 !important;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-wi