on: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n    padding: 15px;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>We’re open but all our chat agents are currently busy supporting other customers.</p>\n<p>We’ll keep checking the team’s availability for you and update this message when we’re able to connect you.</p>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n    padding: 15px;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our live chat is currently closed.</p>\n<p>You can discuss changes and queries with our chat team within our opening hours:</p>\n<p>Monday - Friday - 08:00 - 20:00<br/>Saturday - 09:00 - 17:00<br/>Sunday - 10:00 - 16:00<br/>Opening times may vary on bank holidays.</p>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001779:{id:33001779,name:"AV-UKD-HS-DW-Save",r:"<style>\n.aviva-button-avail {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-avail:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-avail:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed-avail {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our Live Chat team will be happy to help.</p>\n<p>You can speak to them during these times:</p>\n<p>Monday to Friday: 9:00am – 5:00pm</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-avail\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-Nuance-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353 !important;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\ncursor: default !important;\npointer-events: none !important;\n}\n#Nuance-chat-Service-EMBED1 > div[style*=\"cursor: pointer\"] {\n  cursor: default !important;\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Sorry, all of our agents are busy right now.</p>\n<p>You will be able to message our Live Chat team when they are available.</p>\n<p>You can speak to them during these times:</p>\n<p>Monday to Friday: 9:00am – 5:00pm</p>\n<a class=\" aviva-Nuance-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\ncursor: default !important;\npointer-events: none !important;\n}\n#Nuance-chat-Service-EMBED1 > div[style*=\"cursor: pointer\"] {\n  cursor: default !important;\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Our Live Chat team is not available at the moment.</p>\n<p>You can speak to them during these times:</p>\n<p>Monday to Friday: 9:00am – 5:00pm</p>\n</div>",d:"<span></span>",ralt:null,balt:null,ahalt:null,dalt:null,renderAsHTML:true},33001781:{id:33001781,name:"AV-UKD-IVA-AOHome",r:"<style>\n.aviva-button-avail {\n    background: #ffd900;\n    border-color: #ffd900;\n    border-style: solid;\n    color: #004fb6;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    transition: background-color .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s;\n}\n.aviva-button-avail:hover {\n    background: #004fb6;\n    border-color: #004fb6;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-button-avail:active {\n    background-color: #002185;\n    border-color: #002185;\n    color: #fff;\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\n\n}\n.aviva-fixed-avail {\n   cursor: default !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Welcome, you should see the live chat button in just a moment. Click or tap to start chatting to our friendly team.</p>\n<a class=\"aviva-button-avail\" href=\"#\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",b:"<style>\n.aviva-Nuance-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353 !important;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n\n.aviva-fixed {\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n\n.aviva-fixed a.contact-link {\n    pointer-events: auto !important;\n    cursor: pointer !important;\n    text-decoration: underline; /* optional */\n}\n\n#Nuance-chat-Service-EMBED1 > div[style*=\"cursor: pointer\"] {\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n  <p>\n    Our live chat team is busy helping other customers right now. \n    Please check back later, or use our \n    <a class=\"contact-link\" href=\"https://help.online.aviva.co.uk/contact-form\">contact form</a>.\n  </p>\n  <p>Our live chat operating hours are:</p>\n  <p>\n    Monday to Friday, 8:00am to 8:00pm<br/>\n    Saturday, 9:00am to 5:00pm<br/>\n    Sundays and bank holidays, 10:00am to 4:00pm\n  </p>\n  <a class=\"aviva-Nuance-button-disabled\" href=\"#\" aria-disabled=\"true\">Start a Live Chat</a>\n</div>",ah:"<style>\n.aviva-button-disabled {\n    background-color: #ccc;\n    border-color: #ccc;\n    color: #535353;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    cursor: default;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    appearance: none;\n    border: 1px solid #737373;\n    border-width: 0;\n    border-radius: 0.25em;\n    font-size: 1em;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.5625em;\n    margin: 0;\n    min-width: 6.25em;\n    padding: 0.875em 1.875em;\n    position: relative;\n    text-align: center;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    user-select: none;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: auto;\n}\n.aviva-fixed a.contact-link {\n    pointer-events: auto !important;\n    cursor: pointer !important;\n    text-decoration: underline; /* optional */\n}\n.aviva-fixed {\ncursor: default !important;\npointer-events: none !important;\n}\n#Nuance-chat-Service-EMBED1 > div[style*=\"cursor: pointer\"] {\n  cursor: default !important;\n  pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n.aviva-fixed p {\n    margin: 0.625em 0;\n    cursor: default !important;\n    pointer-events: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aviva-fixed\">\n<p>Sorry, live chat isn't available right now. Please come back during our operating hours:</p>\n<p>Monday to Friday, 8:00am to 8:00pm<br/>Saturday, 9:00am to 5:00pm<br/>Sundays and bank holidays, 10:00am to 4:00pm</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you can use our <a class=\"contact-link\" href=\"https://help.online.aviva.co.uk/contact-form\" target=\"_blank\">contact fo